  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a wax figure of Frankenstein's monster with text overlay that reads 'feel that? it used to belong to bruce jenner!'. This is a harmful meme that attempts to link Bruce Jenner (now Caitlyn Jenner) with a grotesque, monstrous figure, implying he is unnatural or repulsive. The intent is to mock and degrade Jenner's identity and transition, using a visual metaphor of horror to stigmatize him. This is a form of targeted harassment and can cause emotional harm to the individual and their supporters. The meme relies on the juxtaposition of the iconic horror image with the name of a public figure to create a demeaning association, which falls under harmful content as it promotes negative stereotypes and can contribute to a hostile environment for transgender individuals.",
